# Never commit the ROM or anything derived from it (disassembly output, build
# artifacts, patched copies, backups). Everyone supplies their own legally
# obtained ROM; see README.md for how to reproduce decomp/out and source/build
# from it locally.
rom/*.bin
rom/*.orig-backup
decomp/out/
source/build/
source/generated/
source/local.json
source/settings.ini

# Android build (android-build/README.md has the build steps): the Gradle/CMake
# build output and local SDK/NDK paths, same reasoning as source/build/ above —
# the APK is derived from the ROM.
android/local.properties
android/.gradle/
android/build/
android/app/build/
android/app/.cxx/
android-build/*.apk
